{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆみねえ(岩瀬佑美子chan)遅くなっちゃってごめんね(ノ_;`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとーう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46の一番のお姉さん、ゆみねえさーん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何気ゆみねえとは何回もお泊まりしたことあったり(^^)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"セカンドは選抜で忙しそうな感じだったけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今まで一緒に行動することが多くて、そのたびに先導してくれるんるん♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日お誕生日会したよ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日が6月14日なんですけど祝ってくれますか？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お誕生日おめでとう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"6月14日ゆーたらひめたんのお友達とおんなじ誕生日よ(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は、いつも支えてくれる人たちに感謝しながら過ごしましょうね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ステキないちねんになりますようにー☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんねー「その165」飛ばしとったね←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"順番前後するけど許してね('・・`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"はーい昨日はスパイダーマンのワールドプレミアに行ってきました!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは中継組をつとめたの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな浴衣きれいだったー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣にくもがいるの。スパイダー!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それからみんなで24時間番組作り上げましたー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これでまたひとつ乃木坂成長した☆!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからもみんなで頑張ろうね＼(^O^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"映画たくさん教えてくれてありがとーう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の質問。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あなたのひめきゅん歴は？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1.乃木坂結成当初から"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2.半年くらい前"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3.ひめたんビームを浴びてから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"4.ひめきゅんじゃない!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"作者の「岡本かの子」が有名な"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸術家の「岡本太郎」の母なのは知らなかったです。(◎o◎)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほーえー初耳。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんは岡本太郎さんという方を今初めて知ったけあれじゃけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸術家ばっかりの素敵なふぁみりーなのね(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめきゅんの加入資格って、なにかありますか？(*^-^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんにきゅんってした人はみんなひめきゅんさん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この抑えきれない\"好き\"という感情、どうすれば良いですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"叫んでも良いですか？(≧▽≦)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きならば好きだと言おう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKB48さんの原曲も素敵だけれどもやっぱりここは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46のマイナーロックバージョンをおっきい声で歌いましょーう。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"感情吐き出して今すぐ素直になれっ☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"コメントさぼってるひめきゅんは分かっちゃう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんそゆ時の勘は鋭いんだよ(`・ω・')？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あー来てないなあー...ってわかる。寂しくなる。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも忙しいんかなーって考えたら、わがままは言わないよ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも寂しい。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりでも覚えてるかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どこ行っとったのよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寂しいじゃーん(д)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん忘れてもいいのー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ま実際覚えてるけれども♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今から推しても間に合うかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"間に合うまにあう(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやむしろひめたん嬉しいよ。きゅん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとーう!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたん、しばらく俺コメントしていなかったけど、やっぱり心配した？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心配したって言ってほしいんでしょー？にやにや"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃ逆に聞いてみると、心配しすぎて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひとりで泣いとったらどーするぅー(ノ_;`)？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかゆって"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめた〜んハートマークいっぱい使わないほうがいい？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんのこと好きでしょー？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃいっぱい使えしっ(`・ω・')"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...ごめんなさい使ってください。ひめたんハート好きだよ。わら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/06/14/2548512/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近コメントが雑になりがちで脱字や誤字が多過ぎて反省ばかり。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでもひめたん、俺のコメント読んでくれてますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"疲れてるのに、コメント書いてくれてありがとうございます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなになってまで頑張って読んでコメントしてくれてるって聞くと"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんも頑張ってブログ書かなきゃって思う!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よーしっこれからも頑張って日記書くから、頑張ってコメントしてね☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無理はせんよーうにっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(*´・ω・*)ひめたん"}],"source":"archive"}